# UNAPPLIED engineering candidate ONLY. NOT FOR FLIGHT.
# Entire Here4 removed, no separate compass. VIO must supply validated yaw.
# Dual-profile bridge now recognizes this exact candidate while disarmed.
# Requires actual transport/fusion validation, calibrated VIO, clipping mitigation,
# correct origin/home/heading alignment, ground/SITL EKF tests, loss-of-VIO strategy.
# Barometer remains height source; VIO supplies horizontal position and XYZ velocity.
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3
EK3_ENABLE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 6
EK3_SRC1_YAW 6
EK3_SRC_OPTIONS 0
VISO_TYPE 3
GPS1_TYPE 0
GPS2_TYPE 0
COMPASS_ENABLE 0
VISO_ORIENT 0
VISO_POS_X 0.13
VISO_POS_Y 0
VISO_POS_Z 0.05
VISO_QUAL_MIN 40
# Origin/home must be supplied correctly for the site; deliberately omitted here.
# Do not change AHRS_OPTIONS to restore an all-zero or stale origin.
# VISO_DELAY_MS and noise parameters require measured tuning, not guessed presets.
# No RC source-switch, scripting or arming-check bypass is added.
